{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, build, upgrade and defend, in this gruesome shooter meets tower defense. Carefully balance between economy and upgrading your weapon or towers. How many waves can you survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the demo is singleplayer-only, it does contain online leaderboards. The full version of the game will contain online coop, more weapons, upgrades, turret &amp; enemy types, and much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is shattered by an apocalyptic asteroid impact, releasing a virus mutating humans into oil-craving, biomechanical horrors. As the lone survivor aboard your oil rig, you must protect your central oil intake, your last remaining lifeline, from endless waves of mutants.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare during the day, fight during the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your core to increase your income, but don't be greedy, or you might find yourself lacking defenses. Build and upgrade towers, or buff your weapon instead. The better your aim, the fewer defenses you'll need!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you last? Compete with other players online to reach the best highscore. The more waves you survive, and the more enemies you kill, the higher you'll rise!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Breath","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084800/b7c692399ada81f2ba918c3bb3f3203c469ed3e9.jpg"},{"name":"No Surrender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084800/0a4aca2ce20684ba4b47d8315f2439c2737ce088.jpg"},{"name":"Oilmagnate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084800/ba93a97168f9e840e70636bffccd2100ed0d1566.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea